#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/AhTheIndigoViolet
msgctxt "/834BC6CA4907D49322AE129501B1E48D"
msgid "Ah, the Indigo Violet Compact Power Generator!"
msgstr "おっと、インディゴバイオレット小型発電機だ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/AhTheIndigoViolet
msgctxt "/3B9350C4434FBC6807024E95FEC2BB3F"
msgid "But it seems to be inoperable."
msgstr "でも、動かないみたいだね。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/AhTheIndigoViolet
msgctxt "/7F41F6DB45DEA7786DF7C3BDBC872687"
msgid "Looks like it's missing a piece. Can you find it?"
msgstr "部品が足りないみたいだ。キミ、探してきてくれる？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/AhThereYouAreBuddy
msgctxt "/22421F944422B59DBBF72499C47DA2BE"
msgid "Ah, there you are buddy!"
msgstr "おっ、そこにいたか！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/CarefulBehindStage
msgctxt "/FC10A2564B08311B771D22A3B0B52029"
msgid "Hey buddy. I've got eyes all over the park, but I can't see anything behind the stage."
msgstr "ねえキミ。ボクはパーク中に目があるんだけど、ステージの裏だけは何も見えないんだ。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/CarefulBehindStage
msgctxt "/E75C761E48FF264604FDB7AAE4A96B5A"
msgid "If you're going back there be careful."
msgstr "あっちへ行くなら、気をつけてね。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/CarefulBehindStage
msgctxt "/5543FC63418BA6FC7023749F1C204A3F"
msgid "Your Critter Cuff is not yet able to resuscitate you!"
msgstr "キミのクリッターカフは、まだ蘇生機能が使えないんだからさ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/FinleyPlush
msgctxt "/88A3F07247E6FA238F39C2906D21BD26"
msgid "Ooh, you found my buddy Finley!"
msgstr "おお、ボクの親友フィンリーを見つけたね！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/FinleyPlush
msgctxt "/1001A3F541D2A93E8910758AD95720E3"
msgid "You know, he’s really shy, like, TOO shy."
msgstr "あいつ、ほんとに恥ずかしがり屋でさ。ちょっと度が過ぎるくらい。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/FinleyPlush
msgctxt "/C3008952445A5304DF21868CC2496E2E"
msgid "Like, OBNOXIOUSLY shy, but he’s got a good heart."
msgstr "いや、うっとうしいほど内気なんだけど、根はいいヤツなんだ。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/FinleyPlush
msgctxt "/ABE13D14416F497C3442E987740F6D2E"
msgid "I hope you get to meet him someday!"
msgstr "いつかキミにも会わせてあげたいなあ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/GoldenRambleyPlush
msgctxt "/E413E49549EB3596D1753FB1C8CF93E1"
msgid "Wow, is that a limited edition gold Rambley plush?!"
msgstr "うわあ、それって限定版のゴールドランブリーぬいぐるみ！？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/GoldenRambleyPlush
msgctxt "/22EAC93D421125F0E2BB8BAE44AB4985"
msgid "Parents were fighting tooth and nail for those things when they came out!"
msgstr "発売当時はね、親たちが爪と牙をむいて奪い合ったんだ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/GoldenRambleyPlush
msgctxt "/FE2480C94575225379D1F4860A78DB5C"
msgid "Seriously, our employees had to clean up SO many stray teeth and nails!"
msgstr "マジめな話、抜けた爪と歯の片づけがそれはもう大変で！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/GoldenRambleyPlush
msgctxt "/4526D2E248545EAA741BDB93C2B2F22C"
msgid "Hard to believe there was all that demand for a regular Rambley plush"
msgstr "ただのランブリーぬいぐるみに金のスプレーを吹いただけなのに、"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/GoldenRambleyPlush
msgctxt "/AA19C5294B493C51E6F22586C52FF46B"
msgid "we just blasted with gold spray paint…"
msgstr "あんなに欲しがられたなんて、今でも信じられないよ…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/LloydPlush
msgctxt "/FD259A0548078BD0DFF38F9707BFF5DE"
msgid "ew lloyd..."
msgstr "うわ、ロイドか…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/MolliePlush
msgctxt "/06AE2E544E19EF2EA7AE31AA14AA1CF2"
msgid "Oh, a Mollie plush!"
msgstr "お、モリーのぬいぐるみだ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/MolliePlush
msgctxt "/5FA827C040F72874D8231C8A7B8987FB"
msgid "She’s always been my best friend!"
msgstr "彼女とはずっと大の親友なんだ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/MolliePlush
msgctxt "/C6F8725E4F80D32AA26946BBAB06D77E"
msgid "Did you know she builds planes in her Landing Pad at the park?!"
msgstr "知ってた？ モリーはパークのランディングパッドで飛行機を作ってるんだよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/MolliePlush
msgctxt "/01412AA24D8F512493B8CC94E0C78991"
msgid "And then she crashes them!"
msgstr "そんで、墜落させるんだ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/MolliePlush
msgctxt "/6A4433C84ACD1C523A0563A1DC2D7FC7"
msgid "She’s so talented! "
msgstr "ほんと、才能のかたまりだよね！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/PercyPoodle
msgctxt "/0BF58222496A6F75CF01E38BDC921148"
msgid "Hey buddy, did you dig that out of the lost and found?! Or was it in the trash?"
msgstr "ねえキミ、それ落とし物入れから掘り出してきたの！？ それともゴミ箱？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/PercyPoodle
msgctxt "/A6F72D414A09C95FE245FB86DCC89B27"
msgid "No surprise a guest at our park would dispose of a non indigo-brand toy!"
msgstr "インディゴブランドじゃないおもちゃなんて、うちのお客さんなら捨てて当然だよね！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/PercyPoodle
msgctxt "/25710D5B4271F0F8D2CF5EA4CC6374E5"
msgid "I suppose he’d make playtime special for a child with poor taste, though!"
msgstr "まあ、趣味の悪い子どもにとっては、特別な遊び相手になるんじゃないかな！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/Rambleberry
msgctxt "/7402598D49946935F84C7A97B6642181"
msgid "WOAH, where’d you get that?! Rambleberries are my FAVORITE!"
msgstr "うわあ、それどこで手に入れたの！？ ランブルベリーはボクの大好物なんだ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/Rambleberry
msgctxt "/A46B5A394C27A3176E224CB4D1294141"
msgid "Oh, if only I could jump out of the screen and take a big bite…"
msgstr "ああ、画面から飛び出して、思いっきりかぶりつけたらなあ…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/Rambleberry
msgctxt "/C31B98334D10B743C2229481766F0384"
msgid "DON’T EAT IT! MAYBE I’LL BE ABLE TO ONE DAY!"
msgstr "食べちゃダメだよ！ いつかボクが食べられる日が来るかもしれないんだから！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyCup
msgctxt "/C7B4680A4B6975C8321B0AA849E6F734"
msgid "Ooo! That’s a Rambley Cup! "
msgstr "おおっ！ それはランブリーカップだ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyCup
msgctxt "/717A51E74BCB24090485489B9C2EC6B0"
msgid "Nothing beats the taste of fresh Rambleberry Juice drunk"
msgstr "採れたてのランブルベリージュースはね、"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyCup
msgctxt "/10B0934140D9DCFEAE5C74894EEC0169"
msgid "directly out of my plastic, lifeless head!"
msgstr "ボクのプラスチック製の、命なき頭から直接飲むのが一番なのさ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyEars
msgctxt "/65A1CE3B4BBFDFB450AAC393C5344010"
msgid "Rambley ears! Those used to fly off the shelves!"
msgstr "ランブリーの耳だ！ 昔は棚から飛ぶように売れたんだよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyEars
msgctxt "/0DAC966A4F3C8A06354B37A6594A2E46"
msgid "That pair is pretty damaged, though…keep your eyes peeled."
msgstr "そいつはだいぶ傷んでるけどね…目を皿にして探してごらん。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyEars
msgctxt "/5287BF6D43FFEC7CC014CF8058A3F4D3"
msgid "There’s GOTTA be at least one more mint condition set out there somewhere"
msgstr "どこかに新品同様のがもう一組、絶対に残ってるはずなんだ。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyEars
msgctxt "/26FBFCE249B422095B877792124AFC36"
msgid "…like a yard sale!"
msgstr "…ガレージセールとかにさ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyHead
msgctxt "/44E8A4A04222039B831E969B727783C7"
msgid "Woah! Where’d you find that?!"
msgstr "うわっ！ それどこで見つけたの！？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyHead
msgctxt "/78F7514F454DE7E11E4C09976730DF62"
msgid "I’ve never seen anyone wearing one! Pretty snazzy…"
msgstr "着てる人なんて見たことないよ！ なかなかイケてるね…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyHead
msgctxt "/DB93FE7F4994F3CC90D3349C3C911BDF"
msgid "Ooooh, looks like there’s an audio recording tagged with "
msgstr "おおっ、データベースに「コスチューム」ってタグの付いた"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyHead
msgctxt "/F2C9CC6D4E5DE90244D81CBE7F233568"
msgid "“COSTUME” in my database I’ve never noticed before! Let’s listen, let’s listen!"
msgstr "音声記録があるみたいだ。今まで気づかなかった！ 聴こう、聴いてみよう！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyHead
msgctxt "/6D9716764962E8020A72DFB200F646C0"
msgid "Hey Jackson, you hear about the new mascots?"
msgstr "なあジャクソン、新しいマスコットの話、聞いたか？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyHead
msgctxt "/5C30F1E14FC4808EAE54DE8689AE9BB1"
msgid "Yeah, think it'll put us out of a job?"
msgstr "ああ。オレたち、仕事なくなるんじゃねえか？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyHead
msgctxt "/EBDB2C264D36A50CFE9C77AC71A7AC30"
msgid "I think so, Old Sport, and right after we got this damn raccoon costume."
msgstr "だろうな、オールドスポート。このクソみたいなアライグマの着ぐるみをもらった直後にだぜ。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyHead
msgctxt "/DF800FF14249015021480DB8BCF5483A"
msgid "Man, screw this place. "
msgstr "あーもう、こんなとこやってらんねえ。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyHead
msgctxt "/4866D6EC43E2CFCD97FA249394073D82"
msgid "I say we get our asses out of here and go straight to Vegas. "
msgstr "とっととバックレて、まっすぐベガスにでも行こうぜ。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyHead
msgctxt "/09AB74B8477BBA5AD6D8A291E2D8D7D5"
msgid "Ugh, come on! They didn’t even document the Indigo Inventory ID for the costume!"
msgstr "うわ、なんだよ！ コスチュームのインディゴ在庫IDすら記録してないじゃないか！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyHead
msgctxt "/3787298E4503290F25F58B9DAC9B8129"
msgid "I was REALLY looking forward to that…What a useless recording. DELETED."
msgstr "すごく楽しみにしてたのに…なんの役にも立たない記録だ。削除。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyPlush
msgctxt "/F7058660460C8D25162FE696F15EDA1D"
msgid "CONGRATULATIONS! You found ME! Don’t I look adorable?"
msgstr "おめでとう！ ボクを見つけたね！ かわいいでしょ？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyRactionFigure
msgctxt "/71FBD1B6486E01CB12459AB06AFB49FB"
msgid "Ooh, ooh! I got this! I know the commercial by heart!"
msgstr "ねえねえ、それ知ってる！ コマーシャルなら暗記してるよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyRactionFigure
msgctxt "/4F217C844A8F478935AE57B9FF2F47DB"
msgid "WOW! It’s the unlimited-edition Rambley The Racoon Raction Figure!"
msgstr "うわあ！ 無限定版ランブリー・ザ・ラクーン ラクションフィギュア！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyRactionFigure
msgctxt "/F519511A45917ACCA09BA28DF0B924F8"
msgid "Push him down and he jumps! Push him up and he doesn’t!"
msgstr "下に押すと飛び跳ねる！ 上に押すと飛び跳ねない！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RambleyRactionFigure
msgctxt "/ABB31D9648693D1BD04AE5B01890136A"
msgid "Only $19.99 at your favorite toy store!"
msgstr "お近くのおもちゃ屋さんで、たったの19.99ドル！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RetroLloyd
msgctxt "/73A6F4954E39CA63F2BAAAB4CD490064"
msgid "Ugh…I don’t get why we even have those."
msgstr "うーん…なんでこんなの置いてるんだろうね。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RetroLloyd
msgctxt "/DD313EB34734E4674A37C6ACECF1B5E8"
msgid "And why did they only make one of LLOYD?"
msgstr "しかも、どうしてロイドのだけ作ったのさ？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RetroLloyd
msgctxt "/AD214CEB4C1452301120DA9D782DED25"
msgid " Is it because he’s the loudest?"
msgstr "いちばん声がデカいから？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RetroLloyd
msgctxt "/D344A1A242D2EE2339AE6C9DB2385206"
msgid "I CAN BE LOUD TOO!"
msgstr "ボクだって大声出せるんだからね！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RetroLloyd
msgctxt "/2329F1B742DA73E8B30F7783DC867784"
msgid "WHERE’S MY LIMITED-EDITION THROWBACK PLUSH?! "
msgstr "ボクの限定復刻ぬいぐるみはどこ！？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RetroLloyd
msgctxt "/DEE0D0914686192065F077B037F920F0"
msgid "WHERE’S MOLLIE’S? WHERE’S FINLEY’S?"
msgstr "モリーのは？ フィンリーのは？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Collectables/RetroLloyd
msgctxt "/DE1CD5634D597912A9E762B23B60A5B3"
msgid "Give this mistake to a child and they’ll cry."
msgstr "こんな失敗作、子どもにあげたら泣いちゃうよ。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ConductorRambley
msgctxt "/2D50BDC948FCA5E081E6D0A85E6F7172"
msgid "Welcome to Rambley’s Railroad! I’m Conductor Rambley!"
msgstr "ようこそランブリー鉄道（Rambley's Railroad）へ！ 車掌のランブリーです！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ExplainingInfo
msgctxt "/9D5BC2AA4BE8C263319CC9AC7D0189E2"
msgid "This here's an information kiosk!"
msgstr "ここはインフォメーションキオスクだよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ExplainingInfo
msgctxt "/748FAFB445B1357BE0B9A0AAF7DA6E07"
msgid "If there's anything around the park you wanna ask me about"
msgstr "パークのことで聞きたいことがあったら、"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ExplainingInfo
msgctxt "/73B2BCBF4C68144C9233EB89863C2EE7"
msgid "Just stop by here and I'll"
msgstr "ここに寄ってくれれば、"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ExplainingInfo
msgctxt "/46AB6C524D2092343649E4B1FE00707E"
msgid "ramble"
msgstr "ランブリーだけに"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ExplainingInfo
msgctxt "/26BFA643449282ABF39AAFA82B725AB6"
msgid "on about it!"
msgstr "ランランと語っちゃうよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/C97675EF4AE19B3B96512B92F4F137D3"
msgid "Welcome to the Rambley's Ranglers (registered) room!"
msgstr "ようこそ、ランブリーズ・ラングラー（登録商標）ルームへ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/7EA68FE54873195280A40684E30004A9"
msgid "Here we have plenty of amenities and— ahh— okay okay. "
msgstr "ここには充実した設備が——ああ——うん、わかった、わかったよ。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/EA82C583437B3D865CB5799154964505"
msgid "I can see in your facial tracking that you're scared- CONFUSED— angry-y-y upset-…"
msgstr "キミの顔認識データに出てる。怖がって——混乱して——怒って、いや、動揺し——"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/75A92DE04A0BFC4061DE31945E5C9659"
msgid "transparency is an important part of our policy here at indigo park so…"
msgstr "透明性はインディゴパークの大切な方針だから…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/848260944C0AEB530F3C7493DB4D1D09"
msgid "I need to be honest about something. "
msgstr "正直に話さなきゃいけないことがあるんだ。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/08C1C0204F101221B16EA5B9C0104761"
msgid "The park has been inactive for years, employees stopped showing up, guests too… the mascots are… "
msgstr "このパークは何年も止まってる。従業員は来なくなって、お客さんも…マスコットたちは…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/C615E23A46540C702608E6A2FBA1C077"
msgid "I just was so excited to see a visitor and I wanted to be sure you were given the best experience possible!"
msgstr "ただ、久しぶりのお客さんが嬉しくて、最高の体験をしてほしかったんだ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/A902B0B64CF1A0BE20D3F0A23AB58ED5"
msgid "but I was confined to the entrance for so long, I didn’t realize just how much disrepair the park has… fallen into."
msgstr "でもボクはずっと入口に閉じ込められてて、パークがどれだけ…荒れ果てたか、知らなかった。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/29E9398A4E480181AE707098508EF8BF"
msgid " I’m wasting all of your fun time…"
msgstr "キミの楽しい時間を、無駄にしてるね…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/B2016C014F7A526B4FED3EB1FD3C0345"
msgid "Ehh, sorry for the inconvenience…"
msgstr "ああ、ご迷惑をおかけして…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/4BBBDEF641B496132E1A15BCE19D44E2"
msgid "but… BUT!! I have an idea! "
msgstr "でも…でもっ！ いい考えがある！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/6B7E09FC48F52A9566F6A0B41FD0CA26"
msgid "I have access to the repair documentation in my database!"
msgstr "ボクのデータベースには、修理の手順書があるんだ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/9F6F77ED4B29903E9FE1319853A01C3A"
msgid "I just can’t execute most tasks without authorization from a human user…"
msgstr "ただ、人間のユーザーの承認がないと、ほとんどの作業を実行できなくて…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/176825224B2A12437E77FB9EC299C519"
msgid "You must’ve come here because the park matters to you too, right?"
msgstr "キミもこのパークが大切だから、ここに来たんだよね？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/6ED3760846E22F4C52A417A847115713"
msgid "Would you… be willing to help me restore the park?"
msgstr "よかったら…このパークを直すの、手伝ってくれないかな？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/2901D6B64B88B1DF37AD18AD963DD981"
msgid " I can see in your facial tracking data that you aren’t opposed to this!"
msgstr "キミの顔認識データによると、反対じゃなさそうだね！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/FinalMonologue
msgctxt "/76C6F0C84FAD26CBAC49CE8F2E0E8421"
msgid "Oooh, I’m so excited! Let’s get this place back in business!"
msgstr "ああ、ワクワクしてきた！ このパークを営業再開といこう！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/HereYouGoBuddy
msgctxt "/7886F7D74746F8555C00DB804B6732D7"
msgid "Here you go buddy!"
msgstr "はい、どうぞ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/HereYouGoBuddy
msgctxt "/532F7981426754AA37869586A66870C7"
msgid "Your very own Critter Cuff!"
msgstr "キミ専用のクリッターカフ（Critter Cuff）だ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/HereYouGoBuddy
msgctxt "/D00BFCB9495885D105BF2B970A2B4F9E"
msgid "A new way to interact with the park,"
msgstr "パークを楽しむ新しい方法にして、"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/HereYouGoBuddy
msgctxt "/3205C1234BAB07D2135037AA176AF22A"
msgid "that also doubles as a pedometer, heart monitor, and mood ring!"
msgstr "歩数計、心拍計、そして気分リングも兼ねてるんだ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/HereYouGoBuddy
msgctxt "/86610F67464E7D10632218B9AA22BF7D"
msgid "(Data disclosure agreement included)"
msgstr "（データ提供の同意が含まれます）"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/HeyBuddyComeOverHere
msgctxt "/6C75D6DD4DA6D03108B5B980F470CC36"
msgid "Hey buddy! Come over here!"
msgstr "ねえキミ！ こっちこっち！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ILikeTrains
msgctxt "/66B7E2C1447AB17C65B03589D362FC82"
msgid "Your facial data suggests you may be a bit older than the target audience for this ride,"
msgstr "キミの顔データによると、この乗り物の対象年齢より少し上みたいだけど、"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ILikeTrains
msgctxt "/729442494D27B93488D4AB96BBEBB404"
msgid "but it’s one of my favorites!"
msgstr "ボクのお気に入りのひとつなんだ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ILikeTrains
msgctxt "/C1F625A84936E3488DFB9B8A43761BA6"
msgid "Do you know why RAMBLEY the Raccoon loves RAMBLEY’s Railroad?"
msgstr "ランブリー・ザ・ラクーンが、どうしてランブリー鉄道を大好きなのか分かる？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ILikeTrains
msgctxt "/A58C415F45A500F79BD0CF8991A5DA60"
msgid "‘Cause I like trains!"
msgstr "だって、電車が好きだからさ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/JetstreamJunctionislockedup
msgctxt "/F980DD7940719AEC07DAA09993F14C9B"
msgid "Well, look at that! You’re at Jetstream Junction!"
msgstr "おっと、見てごらん！ ジェットストリーム・ジャンクション（Jetstream Junction）だ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/JetstreamJunctionislockedup
msgctxt "/2E3B55A34B4CEA69D1BA2491CDE46472"
msgid "Oops! Looks like Jetstream Junction’s being tuned up!"
msgstr "あちゃー！ いまは調整中みたいだね！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/JetstreamJunctionislockedup
msgctxt "/B50C7EB246B8FEFA0731928ACD67E7F1"
msgid " Last I checked, there’s a security office in the back of the theater."
msgstr "たしか、シアターの奥に警備室があったはずだよ。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/JetstreamJunctionislockedup
msgctxt "/2BA762374D175A7528E7A085FE534896"
msgid "Maybe a friendly Rangler can help you get in!"
msgstr "親切なラングラーが、中に入れてくれるかも！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/LetMeGetaLookatYou
msgctxt "/56DB3AF34213F4C83D6363B1851121B1"
msgid "Hi, I'm Rambley, Rambley the Raccoon"
msgstr "やあ、ボクはランブリー。ランブリー・ザ・ラクーン。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/LetMeGetaLookatYou
msgctxt "/B3FE10A44B99543838CDDCAA2223E63D"
msgid "and it's my job to make sure your experience here at Indigo Park is..."
msgstr "キミのインディゴパークでの時間を、しっかり…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/LetMeGetaLookatYou
msgctxt "/7B3B90E44AF680F4AEDCCCBE38C413AB"
msgid "registered!"
msgstr "登録するのがボクの仕事さ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/LetMeGetaLookatYou
msgctxt "/F1028EF94EFA18B7A083FF865A05761E"
msgid "Let me just get a good look at you!"
msgstr "ちょっとキミの顔をよく見せてね！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/LetMeGetaLookatYou
msgctxt "/FA76CD52488842492FC7C1992CEADC34"
msgid "Hmm, I don't seem to have your face in our guest list."
msgstr "ん、ゲスト名簿にキミの顔が見当たらないな。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/LetMeGetaLookatYou
msgctxt "/51D5ACFD45E3C3CCC3CA26B550D87989"
msgid "Is this your first time here at the park?"
msgstr "パークに来るのは初めて？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/LetMeGetaLookatYou
msgctxt "/CACACA094D6CFEF9387B1EB138320408"
msgid "Or did you just get plastic surgery?"
msgstr "それとも、整形したばかりとか？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/LetMeGetaLookatYou
msgctxt "/6CE3527249699799915857801F1B8FF2"
msgid "No worries! It's Rambley Tuesday,"
msgstr "大丈夫！ 今日はランブリー火曜日だから、"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/LetMeGetaLookatYou
msgctxt "/84D702F14F5E923B0A88FCBCF84DCB30"
msgid "so you qualify for a BIG discount on your visit!"
msgstr "キミは大幅割引の対象だよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/LetMeGetaLookatYou
msgctxt "/EF3FD1C54888E0E783A759BC03788591"
msgid "Just follow me to the main gate!"
msgstr "メインゲートまで、ボクについてきて！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/LetMeGetaLookatYou
msgctxt "/9C4A2F264BED5DB9E8BA699F3E04F626"
msgid "Ooh, I can’t wait for you to see everything Indigo Park has to offer!"
msgstr "ああ、インディゴパークの全部をキミに見せるのが待ちきれないよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/OceanicOdyssey
msgctxt "/987E481542F2E46D6C9607A0A62A9574"
msgid "Wow, you made it to Oceanic Odyssey!"
msgstr "わあ、オーシャニック・オデッセイ（Oceanic Odyssey）まで来たんだね！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/OceanicOdyssey
msgctxt "/163DCA7D490D14C67A88CBA439791DDD"
msgid "You’re doin’ a great job, Rookie Rangler! "
msgstr "いい調子だよ、ルーキー・ラングラー！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/PardonOurDust
msgctxt "/FB1E04CF4ECA2844863556B33D35C601"
msgid "Pardon our dust, buddy! Looks like the park is going through some… renovations."
msgstr "お見苦しくてごめんね！ パークはいま、その…改装中みたいなんだ。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/PardonOurDust
msgctxt "/2DD8CEC14CF82E08ADD968BB5B191546"
msgid "For the inconvenience,"
msgstr "ご迷惑のお詫びとして、"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/PardonOurDust
msgctxt "/FF61318046D5B6B8DFA15FB0C6A502D8"
msgid "your Rambley Tuesday discount will be (free) PERCENT OFF!"
msgstr "ランブリー火曜日の割引は、なんと（無料）パーセントオフ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/PardonOurDust
msgctxt "/A28BCB3B4ACA94A7D814E28732939046"
msgid "Why not celebrate this great deal with a ride on my railroad?"
msgstr "この大盤振る舞いを記念して、ボクの鉄道に乗っていかない？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/PardonOurDust
msgctxt "/E25866E644B5FFBBF0B348A0AF334725"
msgid "To test your sleuthing skills, I’ll let you find this one all by yourself!"
msgstr "キミの探偵の腕試しに、場所はあえて教えないでおくよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Lloyd_Rambley
msgctxt "/14203EE743CC2EC2BA620BA9588B02B4"
msgid "*sigh*"
msgstr "＊ためいき＊"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Lloyd_Rambley
msgctxt "/86FEE8E34F7BC757E9EE0495204F56A0"
msgid "Hey there, Lloyd..."
msgstr "やあ、ロイド…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Lloyd_Rambley
msgctxt "/873A6EF5481685D38EAD11B7F446BE01"
msgid " Do not SHAME me with that COMMON FOLK Name!"
msgstr "そのような下賤な呼び名でワタクシを辱めるでないッ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Lloyd_Rambley
msgctxt "/B892E7394BC195D1E9D1BD999E9F881B"
msgid "I am the PRRRRROUD"
msgstr "ワタクシこそ、誇り高きィィィ"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Lloyd_Rambley
msgctxt "/F6CD5CA04C2C19A3B8D804BF6643C740"
msgid "the PRRRRESTIGIOUS"
msgstr "由緒正しきィィィ"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Lloyd_Rambley
msgctxt "/1E646C23403FEC3B965FB1AB19218861"
msgid "the PRRRRRRROFESSIONAL"
msgstr "真に professional なるゥゥゥ"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Lloyd_Rambley
msgctxt "/F99862CF4B9386BC6CD3A592D176226A"
msgid "Lloydford L. Lion"
msgstr "ロイドフォード・L・ライオン！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Lloyd_Rambley
msgctxt "/08CCE5F54789270F6BA72590906B6A29"
msgid "Actor Extrrrrrrrodinaire"
msgstr "名優中の名優であるゥゥゥ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Lloyd_Rambley
msgctxt "/DE4CB4F24CB428A7958462BC50A37230"
msgid "Great act, Lloyd..."
msgstr "いい芝居だったよ、ロイド…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Lloyd_Rambley
msgctxt "/17978F7F44C74A40A09A358BCB59B682"
msgid " Of course it was! I’m the rrrrrrrea-"
msgstr "当然であるッ！ ワタクシは本物のゥゥゥ——"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Mollie_Rambley
msgctxt "/E8A8613446234D4D9DE5ECB076470360"
msgid "Oh look! It’s Mollie Macaw!"
msgstr "見て！ モリー・マコー（Mollie Macaw）だ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Mollie_Rambley
msgctxt "/8F52BC3F4377D3314A5469AD9D69625A"
msgid "It's Mollie Macaw!"
msgstr "アタシがモリー・マコー！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Mollie_Rambley
msgctxt "/BB5772C54EB66C9E140401BB10B03AE3"
msgid "The greatest pilot you ever saw!"
msgstr "世界一のパイロットさ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Mollie_Rambley
msgctxt "/3D77E398449B090BEEA895BE239A592E"
msgid "You sure are, Moll! Why, you only crashed into six barns this week!"
msgstr "そのとおりだよモリー！ 今週なんて、納屋に六回しかぶつかってないもんね！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Mollie_Rambley
msgctxt "/68FBD8E0471979D81A2580BA1647EE00"
msgid "I'm not crashin', Rambley! I'm barnstormin'!"
msgstr "墜落じゃないよランブリー！ アタシのは曲芸飛行さ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Mollie_Rambley
msgctxt "/A0B777384EBA998E7D36F2A29A09F623"
msgid "Haha! What’s barnstorming? "
msgstr "はは！ 曲芸飛行って何？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Mollie_Rambley
msgctxt "/FC6AD38A4BA3868CBFB585B44EAC3967"
msgid "It's crashing, with style!"
msgstr "かっこよく墜落することさ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Mollie_Rambley
msgctxt "/3591400B46A47FFD55D9D6B2692AC072"
msgid "I-it barely hurts at all!"
msgstr "い、痛くなんてほとんどないよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Mollie_Rambley
msgctxt "/0A4FE7F14727FB8E807897A929F49FBD"
msgid "Say, those young adventurers you’ve got along with you look like GREAT pilots!"
msgstr "ねえ、そこの若い冒険者、腕のいいパイロットになりそうじゃない！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Mollie_Rambley
msgctxt "/724314224F935750F89EEEAFDA7062EE"
msgid "Why not try your hand at flying in my ride, Rooftop Races?"
msgstr "アタシの乗り物、ルーフトップ・レースで飛んでみない？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Railroad_Mollie_Rambley
msgctxt "/7B51A71E43EEA8052F29F5A32AAF637E"
msgid "Admission included with your Critter Cuff."
msgstr "クリッターカフがあれば乗り放題だよ。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyFinleyRoom
msgctxt "/18C0E56A4EE32A48B0CD4888DB24D468"
msgid "Oh, Finley! Come on out and greet the people!"
msgstr "やあフィンリー！ 出てきてお客さんに挨拶してよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyFinleyRoom
msgctxt "/F6D650FF49B7E8CAD5C59393FC5E9FFE"
msgid "hi rambley…"
msgstr "…やあ、ランブリー…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyFinleyRoom
msgctxt "/F2CF4AAD4461D13C077C3A99D31045C3"
msgid "Why the long face? And body?"
msgstr "なんだか浮かない顔だね。顔も体も、長いままだけど。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyFinleyRoom
msgctxt "/062134734F93B974B7FD43AAC1D17F39"
msgid "You’ve known me for 100 years, Rambley."
msgstr "100年も前から知ってるでしょ、ランブリー…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyFinleyRoom
msgctxt "/0C49539D458F82CF58B73885A527761E"
msgid "I’m ALWAYS Long because I’m always LONGING for a new Seashell for my collection…"
msgstr "ぼくがいつも長いのは、コレクションの新しい貝がらを、いつも長らく待ちわびてるから…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyFinleyRoom
msgctxt "/5D06125B488DCE628FE8BE9A7FA9081D"
msgid "Oh, Finley! You should come out of YOUR shell!"
msgstr "もう、フィンリー！ キミこそ殻から出てきなよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyFinleyRoom
msgctxt "/07EE5BD8486F45F682B9B69CDDD53149"
msgid "How about YOU come into it instead?"
msgstr "…そっちが入ってくれば、いいのに。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyFinleyRoom
msgctxt "/DD178E3D40184305B39401BA377B6A03"
msgid "My ride, Oceanic Odyssey,"
msgstr "ぼくの乗り物、オーシャニック・オデッセイは、"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyFinleyRoom
msgctxt "/2E90537C48968833471F5A81425F02F9"
msgid "will teach you all about the wonders down under the deep blue sea."
msgstr "深くて青い海の底の不思議を、ぜんぶ教えてくれるんだ。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyFinleyRoom
msgctxt "/7CAF437A44997EA70F8456827F1A3F23"
msgid "It’s as blue as me."
msgstr "ぼくとおなじくらい、青いよ。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyFinleyRoom
msgctxt "/6BBB16BE47130D9531556C9CE3F24553"
msgid "I hope you’ll visit."
msgstr "来てくれると、うれしいな。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyFinleyRoom
msgctxt "/05F3CA0B456FC8874FF1888E3DA00673"
msgid "I’m so lonely…"
msgstr "ずっと、ひとりぼっちなんだ…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyFinleyRoom
msgctxt "/FADB9EB64DEC3B6C48D9509F0EC6F139"
msgid "Oceanic Odyssey currently closed for repairs!"
msgstr "オーシャニック・オデッセイは、ただいま修理のため休止中！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyScene_4_WelcomeToIndigoPark
msgctxt "/E731A9DF444B1EA5C8AADF8ED0B0EB82"
msgid "Okay, for real this time."
msgstr "よし、今度こそ本番。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyScene_4_WelcomeToIndigoPark
msgctxt "/6F6C8FEE4CB06AEF04D499B9A9307583"
msgid "Welcome to Indigo Park!"
msgstr "ようこそ、インディゴパークへ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyScene_5_OhSillyRambley
msgctxt "/0E06FC1B410E9AC20433BAAF0E3D41CD"
msgid "Oh, silly Rambley!"
msgstr "おっと、ボクとしたことが！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyScene_5_OhSillyRambley
msgctxt "/38BFCDDA4EABC881E04D9494D8750942"
msgid "Every guest needs a Critter Cuff!"
msgstr "お客さまには全員、クリッターカフが必要なんだった！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyScene_5_OhSillyRambley
msgctxt "/8EB46E864032EB97C7F4148BEB309DE1"
msgid "That will allow you to access reserved areas,"
msgstr "あれがあれば、関係者エリアに入れて、"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyScene_5_OhSillyRambley
msgctxt "/BC5C395C4054805AC80502B13FE6B14F"
msgid "charge payments to your room,"
msgstr "お部屋にお代をつけられて、"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyScene_5_OhSillyRambley
msgctxt "/849B6B3D495313A0970CC2B152D5EF30"
msgid "and"
msgstr "それから"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyScene_5_OhSillyRambley
msgctxt "/830447E94EEAF71E8C4C0791202748F9"
msgid "wear a critter cuff!"
msgstr "クリッターカフを着けられる！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyScene_5_OhSillyRambley
msgctxt "/D1FCB35D452481EC245A99BAB6EFD9D4"
msgid "I think there’s some in the gift shop."
msgstr "たしかギフトショップに置いてあったはずだよ。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyScene_5_OhSillyRambley
msgctxt "/7FBBDB774E50BFBB81DB21BAE8942AD1"
msgid "Head in there and I’ll get you set up!"
msgstr "入ってみて。ボクが手続きしてあげる！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyScene_8_HoorayGreatWorkBuddy
msgctxt "/2FF403CC4771A03B85A143AF658DFE0D"
msgid "Hooray! Great work, buddy!"
msgstr "やったね！ よくできました！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyScene_8_HoorayGreatWorkBuddy
msgctxt "/F1A99EAB4E01277DC8D9D7B47F5D4DF5"
msgid "Now try entering the park,"
msgstr "じゃあパークに入ってみて、"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RambleyScene_8_HoorayGreatWorkBuddy
msgctxt "/8B05A99D480260177C306F931BDFB020"
msgid "and we can start our Indigo Adventure!"
msgstr "インディゴ・アドベンチャーの始まりだ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RooftopRacesBeBroke
msgctxt "/DEBF200148AE7F19D61EDDB589059AD1"
msgid "Oh no, this is horrible…"
msgstr "ああ、これはひどいな…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RooftopRacesBeBroke
msgctxt "/070D062544A579EE25872B979B9E8D80"
msgid "Ehhh, Looks like Mollie crashed into the Ride again!"
msgstr "あちゃー、モリーがまた乗り物に突っ込んだみたいだ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RooftopRacesBeBroke
msgctxt "/1B6CC5B347A521E6869535951B9D28B8"
msgid "Don’t worry, though. Your pal Rambley has the repairman on speed dial!"
msgstr "でも心配ないよ。相棒のランブリーは、修理屋を短縮ダイヤルに入れてあるからね！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RooftopRacesBeBroke
msgctxt "/5BED2A584F6B02400AD85DABDD79D671"
msgid "     "
msgstr "     "

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RooftopRacesBeBroke
msgctxt "/D6F268E04E3A75338CD3D0BFB66561D3"
msgid "We're sorry, the number you have dialed has been disconnected or is no longer in service."
msgstr "おかけになった電話番号は、現在使われておりません。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RooftopRacesBeBroke
msgctxt "/AFBECB154F4B272FFDBF8F967FD0FA88"
msgid "Please check the number and dial again."
msgstr "番号をお確かめのうえ、おかけ直しください。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RooftopRacesBeBroke
msgctxt "/C8C274264E4978CDDEA1B5835AC38B78"
msgid "…Say, why don’t you check out Mollie’s Landing Pad?"
msgstr "…ところで、モリーのランディングパッドに行ってみない？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RooftopRacesBeBroke
msgctxt "/A842E8D34661E0B3E78032B7DB292F03"
msgid "It’s not far from here, and it’s a great cool down after that exhilarating ride!"
msgstr "ここから近いし、あのスリルのあとのクールダウンにぴったりだよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RooftopRacesBeBroke
msgctxt "/A0B86D8B410E8F4C2A0D8CB7FAEFDD3A"
msgid "Just take a DOWN from Mollie’s Rooftop Races!"
msgstr "ルーフトップ・レースから、下に降りるだけさ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RookieRanglersRoomHall
msgctxt "/D8798D2547F4E9735E7D94887A32B9B3"
msgid "Uh oh! That Rambley’s Ranglers Room is only accessible by Royal Ranglers!"
msgstr "おっと！ ランブリーズ・ラングラー・ルームは、ロイヤル・ラングラー専用なんだ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RookieRanglersRoomHall
msgctxt "/648067C240BA28083918F0B6616A070B"
msgid "Maybe one day you’ll grow up big and strong enough to enter it!"
msgstr "いつかキミも、入れるくらい大きく強くなれるかもね！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/RookieRanglersRoomHall
msgctxt "/955FC30B42E4B37DBC0683A68F586727"
msgid "But for now, don’t."
msgstr "でも今は、ダメ。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Surface
msgctxt "/A073CB0947D30451CAFFF289D08EE31A"
msgid "You’ll find a potpourri of porpoises, pickerels and perches as far as the eye can see,"
msgstr "見渡すかぎり、イルカもカワカマスもスズキも、よりどりみどり。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Surface
msgctxt "/B20C890648DE5FC7F0C701B946CCBF9D"
msgid "but please don’t tap the glass."
msgstr "でも、ガラスを叩くのはやめてね。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Surface
msgctxt "/455BB1E14DD32D9328F2598265637886"
msgid "You never really know what lies beneath the surface…"
msgstr "水面の下に何がいるかなんて、誰にも分からないんだから…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/TakeanUpAtMollie_sLandingPad
msgctxt "/43726669453D2DB8C4626381A15FAB1C"
msgid "Say, why don’t you check out Mollie’s Rooftop Races?"
msgstr "ねえ、モリーのルーフトップ・レース（Rooftop Races）に行ってみない？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/TakeanUpAtMollie_sLandingPad
msgctxt "/908A2E2746DB0E332A8BF2BE0A7B3941"
msgid "It’s not far from here, "
msgstr "ここから近いし、"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/TakeanUpAtMollie_sLandingPad
msgctxt "/1A7E083E4FB14BD3B9A8499C69B7654B"
msgid "and it’s a great warm up before we get into the bigger rides!"
msgstr "大きい乗り物に挑む前のウォームアップにぴったりだよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/TakeanUpAtMollie_sLandingPad
msgctxt "/102E11B442468DF3E59E66855B78179C"
msgid "Just take an UP at Mollie’s Landing Pad!"
msgstr "モリーのランディングパッドから、上に登るだけさ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ThatExpiredYesterday
msgctxt "/B760E6AF40B0009A31C0F7800E14CA92"
msgid "Okay! Welcome to the crew, Rookie Rangler (registered)!"
msgstr "よし！ ようこそ仲間へ、ルーキー・ラングラー（登録商標）！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ThatExpiredYesterday
msgctxt "/BCFAE33248018B75BBA465BADC3DEB63"
msgid "Your first official job as one of Rambley’s Ranglers (registered)"
msgstr "ランブリーズ・ラングラー（登録商標）としての最初の任務は、"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ThatExpiredYesterday
msgctxt "/60CC3DAC4D9AC403CC388BBB572AA882"
msgid "is to get out of the Rambley’s Ranglers (registered) Room!"
msgstr "ランブリーズ・ラングラー（登録商標）ルームから脱出すること！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ThatExpiredYesterday
msgctxt "/422DBF83497AEDAF65BCC0AF0DF6D750"
msgid "Head left towards the Rookie Rangler (registered) Security Room to set yourself free!"
msgstr "左のルーキー・ラングラー（登録商標）警備室へ向かって、自由を勝ち取れ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ThatExpiredYesterday
msgctxt "/3831DED24B173DCA7D5C12A41622AD1A"
msgid "Whew! Kinda exhausting to say that whole spiel,"
msgstr "ふう！ この決まり文句、言い切るのはけっこう疲れるんだよね。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ThatExpiredYesterday
msgctxt "/9365B1DF4CE13D36ECB7EC80E45F20AE"
msgid "but Rambley’s Ranglers (registered)  is a registered trademark…."
msgstr "でもランブリーズ・ラングラー（登録商標）は登録商標だから…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/ThatExpiredYesterday
msgctxt "/276ED94C479A7CD030C8FC9EB34B133F"
msgid "that expired yesterday."
msgstr "昨日で切れたけどね。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/TheDoor
msgctxt "/B020C6F14484683BFFB2D292FFD2639D"
msgid "Uh oh! The door mysteriously locked."
msgstr "おっと！ ドアが不思議なことに施錠されちゃった。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/TheDoor
msgctxt "/8038AFBF4E8E9FC4EC2ED4B67D8C0455"
msgid "Why not test out your band and save the day?"
msgstr "キミの腕のバンドを試して、この場を切り抜けてみない？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/TurnontheGeneratorMiniRambleyVenture
msgctxt "/56F41D3A430EE869698C29A6F8D0D803"
msgid "What’s the hold up? The gate is open!"
msgstr "どうしたの？ ゲートは開いてるよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/TurnontheGeneratorMiniRambleyVenture
msgctxt "/8383E1894F48F6D01A35E088BEDCA5FC"
msgid "Head on into the entryway!"
msgstr "入口へどうぞ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/TurnontheGeneratorMiniRambleyVenture
msgctxt "/00EB414F4A44F8D96BDABF850F7658D1"
msgid "hmm.. hold on"
msgstr "んん…ちょっと待って"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/TurnontheGeneratorMiniRambleyVenture
msgctxt "/BC022C89406D656A1D9E36A4F663BE6E"
msgid "My mistake, the Gate is NOT open."
msgstr "ごめん、ゲートは開いてなかった。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/TurnontheGeneratorMiniRambleyVenture
msgctxt "/717554CE4E82E9B8C24D589E2CD07E8B"
msgid "There seems to be an error message being sent from the gate’s power unit!"
msgstr "ゲートの電源ユニットから、エラーが出てるみたいだ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/TurnontheGeneratorMiniRambleyVenture
msgctxt "/2ADA45A64210DD762D3B279C66479803"
msgid "…Lucky you!"
msgstr "…キミ、ラッキーだね！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/TurnontheGeneratorMiniRambleyVenture
msgctxt "/8303326945FF622A9F0D4FB436DE6F1A"
msgid "You get to be first person to try our Turn on the Generator Mini-Rambley-Venture!"
msgstr "記念すべき第一号として「発電機を入れよう ミニ・ランブリーベンチャー」に挑戦できるよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/TurnontheGeneratorMiniRambleyVenture
msgctxt "/1211F3F1447DE5A229B5B9AA147DF598"
msgid "Have fun!"
msgstr "楽しんでね！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/WaitThisRoomIsStaffOnly
msgctxt "/C0704C154BCEFEDE43052FA3C2B6C8B1"
msgid "WAIT HOLD ON, THIS ROOM'S STAFF ONLY!"
msgstr "待って待って、この部屋はスタッフ専用だよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/WaitThisRoomIsStaffOnly
msgctxt "/3C7E77F4489230C4A0F95590FF51605A"
msgid "COME ON IN NEW STAFF!"
msgstr "さあ入って、新人スタッフくん！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/WelcometoIndigoPark
msgctxt "/ECF559324D8EA8A39F3AA9BA18E9CFB4"
msgid "Hi there, and welcome to Indigo Park!"
msgstr "やあ、ようこそインディゴパーク（Indigo Park）へ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/WelcometoIndigoPark
msgctxt "/5B5D00814C57D72CEB00DA9A39CA00C6"
msgid "The world’s most innovative and engaging family fun experience!"
msgstr "世界でいちばん革新的で、夢中になれる家族の遊び場！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/WelcometoIndigoPark
msgctxt "/6F5AD196491E4D4A355277A9F4CA8094"
msgid "Jump into the world of your favorite chara-"
msgstr "大好きなキャラクターの世界に飛び込ん——"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/WelcometoIndigoPark
msgctxt "/22AC14AD42028AD306D66489D8ACBE1F"
msgid "wait"
msgstr "まって"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/WelcometoIndigoPark
msgctxt "/3EFE6BD242E73B9352A4F1BF60574838"
msgid "Wait! You’re our first guest in 2920 days, 4 hours, 23 minutes, and 38 seconds! "
msgstr "待って！ キミ、2920日と4時間23分38秒ぶりのお客さんだ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/WelcometoIndigoPark
msgctxt "/65609BCA4DAB13850C5034A31109FAE4"
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr "おめでとう！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/WelcometoIndigoPark
msgctxt "/48F5C1B2431701D2B8976D84680ECCED"
msgid "I’m Rambley! Rambley the Raccoon"
msgstr "ボクはランブリー！ ランブリー・ザ・ラクーン。"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/WelcometoIndigoPark
msgctxt "/C86567344FC1BB7BB82A1DB256F5D4E4"
msgid "and it’s my job to make sure your experience here at Indigo Park is the most fun it can be!"
msgstr "キミのインディゴパークでの時間を最高に楽しくするのが、ボクの仕事さ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/WelcometoIndigoPark
msgctxt "/C6AFF88A4A767A6036C621B1481851F2"
msgid "Just hop on over to the registration center... to your left!"
msgstr "まずは受付センターへどうぞ…キミの左手だよ！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/WelcometoIndigoPark
msgctxt "/5C2C14DD4041B435D78889983FE844E6"
msgid "where our friendly assistant will help you begin your adventure in the park!"
msgstr "親切なアシスタントが、パークでの冒険の始まりを手伝ってくれるからね！"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Whereyouwannago
msgctxt "/083DA16C47BC5955543071A4BCF929AE"
msgid "So, whaddya think? Pretty fun, right?"
msgstr "どう思った？ なかなか楽しかったでしょ？"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Whereyouwannago
msgctxt "/D21A5610486EFD5BEF6E2195B5F6F16E"
msgid "Now you know all about my friends…"
msgstr "これでボクの友達のことは、ぜんぶ分かったね…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Whereyouwannago
msgctxt "/57AA795A4F4810E4BDB0B5A40D9F0991"
msgid "and Lloyd..."
msgstr "あと、ロイドもね…"

#. property: RambleyFiles/Voice/Whereyouwannago
msgctxt "/500142E343238B588105808A860EBCAD"
msgid "So, where do you wanna go?  "
msgstr "それで、次はどこに行きたい？"

#. property: RefinedMainMenu/Menu/Widgets/KioskMenu
msgctxt "/AA5CF25A41427BA0144C2F8585968A25"
msgid "15Hz"
msgstr "15Hz"

#. property: RefinedMainMenu/Menu/Widgets/KioskMenu
msgctxt "/B7C8DF634D50842541CC7F94F65844A2"
msgid "30Hz"
msgstr "30Hz"

#. property: RefinedMainMenu/Menu/Widgets/KioskMenu
msgctxt "/DD63C93C47841D53F4BF0792B949DCFD"
msgid "60Hz"
msgstr "60Hz"

